---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<div>
		<strong>bluedawn520</strong>
		<span>&copy; {today.getFullYear()}</span>
	</div>
	<blockquote>代码是写给机器的诗，注释是写给人类的信。<cite>— Rob Pike</cite></blockquote>
	<div class="footer-links">
		<span>基于 Astro 构建</span>
		<a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
		<a href="https://github.com/bluedawn520" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
	</div>
</footer>
<style>
	footer {
		max-width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 1.7rem calc((100% - 1320px) / 2);
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		border-top: 2px solid rgb(var(--black));
	}
	blockquote {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		border: 0;
		background: transparent;
		text-align: center;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
	}
	cite {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-left: 0.6rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-style: normal;
	}
	.footer-links {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	a {
		text-decoration: none;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	a:hover {
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		footer {
			display: block;
			padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem;
		}
		.footer-links {
			margin-top: 0.8rem;
			justify-content: flex-start;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
		}
		blockquote {
			margin-top: 0.8rem;
			text-align: left;
		}
	}
</style>
